OL,3,GNEWSACould commuting by steam train be
OL,4,Athe future?
OL,5,
OL,6,FA unique trial that saw Severn Valley
OL,7,FRailway steam and diesel trains help
OL,8,Fpeople travel was used by 1,000
OL,9,Fpassengers - leading to calls to make
OL,10,Fit a permanent service.
OL,12,FFor the last two months heritage trains
OL,13,Fhave been used to carry commuters from
OL,14,FBewdley to Kidderminster, where they
OL,15,Fcan then access mainline services to
OL,16,FBirmingham and beyond.
OL,18,FJohn Dutton, a special needs teacher,
OL,19,Fsaid: "It's brilliant - I think it
OL,20,Fwould be good for tourists as well as
OL,21,Fworkers if they made it a permanent
OL,22,Fthing."
